# Spoken lines are CSV keys. Infantes arrive as allies. Cannot stop the disaster.

~ start
=> arrive

~ arrive
Álvar: a2_bodas.arrive
Ferrán: a2_bodas.ferran
Diego: a2_bodas.diego
Cid: a2_bodas.watch
=> END

~ train
Cid: a2_bodas.train
Ferrán: a2_bodas.train_done
=> END

~ gift
Cid: a2_bodas.gift
Diego: a2_bodas.gift_taken
=> END
